---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout crumb="About" title="About Us – Wawe Journal, the Trading Journal for Traders" description="Wawe Journal is an independent trading journal built by a solo developer. Log trades, analyze your performance and replay the market candle by candle.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="pill anim" style="--d:.05s"><b data-i18n="footer.about">About</b></span>
      <h1 class="anim" style="--d:.15s" data-i18n="about.title">About Us</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="bento">
        <article class="card wide featured reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.founder_title">Wawe Journal</h2>
            <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="about.founder_desc">Wawe Journal (WaweJournal) was founded by a developer passionate about financial markets and software, who wanted one place to journal, review and practice trades.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.mission_title">Our Mission</h2>
            <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="about.mission_desc">To empower traders to track their executions with data-driven clarity, support disciplined decision-making, and improve financial literacy.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.vision_title">Our Vision</h2>
            <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="about.vision_desc">To become the most reliable, modern, and practical trading journal platform in the world, fostering real trader growth.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card wide reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.values_title">Our Values</h2>
            <ul class="prose-list">
              <li><strong data-i18n="about.val_sec_title">Security:</strong> <span data-i18n="about.val_sec_desc">User data privacy and protection are our highest priorities.</span></li>
              <li><strong data-i18n="about.val_trans_title">Transparency:</strong> <span data-i18n="about.val_trans_desc">We are always clear and upfront about how your data is handled.</span></li>
              <li><strong data-i18n="about.val_sim_title">Simplicity:</strong> <span data-i18n="about.val_sim_desc">We design clean, distraction-free interfaces that serve a purpose rather than bloated features.</span></li>
              <li><strong data-i18n="about.val_inno_title">Innovation:</strong> <span data-i18n="about.val_inno_desc">We continuously evolve using cutting-edge development tools and technology.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.team_title">Our Team</h2>
            <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="about.team_desc">To be completely candid, there is no large corporation here — I built this project as a solo developer. No matter what happens, I will never stop building and trying.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="card-title" data-i18n="about.why_title">Why "Wawe"?</h2>
            <p class="card-desc" data-i18n="about.why_desc">"Wawe" is pronounced like "wave" and spelled with a w. It is our take on the word: it symbolizes market cycles, the emotional fluctuations of traders, and the constantly moving financial landscape. Every wave is a new opportunity.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="page-actions">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-line" data-i18n="common.back_home">← Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
